.TH HU20CTL 1 "November 2026" "hu20ctl 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
hu20ctl \- technical control CLI and capture daemon for SecuGen Hamster Pro 20 (HU20)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hu20ctl
[\fIGLOBAL_OPTIONS\fR]
.I COMMAND
[\fIARGUMENTS...\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B hu20ctl
is a pure-Rust command-line tool and background daemon for technical and forensic
operations on the SecuGen Hamster Pro 20 (HU20) optical fingerprint scanner
(USB 1162:2200, 300x400 L8 @ 500 DPI, 120,000 bytes).
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B doctor
Run hardware, udev, permission, and daemon diagnostics.
.TP
.B list
List connected SecuGen HU20 scanners on the USB bus.
.TP
.B capture
Acquire a fingerprint frame and write PNG, TIFF, PGM, RAW, WSQ, JP2, JPEG, or BMP.
.TP
.B enroll
Acquire multiple samples and produce a deterministic enrollment template.
.TP
.B verify
Verify a probe image/template against a reference image/template (1:1 or 1:N).
.TP
.B daemon
Run the exclusive-access Unix Domain Socket capture daemon.
.TP
.B tool
Offline utilities: \fBbench\fR, \fBconvert\fR, \fBenhance\fR.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B HU20_MOCK_FIXTURE
Select a mock scenario (\fBmatch\fR, \fBmismatch\fR, \fBdegraded\fR, \fBempty\fR, \fBdisconnect\fR).
.TP
.B HU20_SOCKET_PATH
Override the Unix Domain Socket path (default: \fI/run/hu20/hu20.sock\fR on Linux, \fI/tmp/hu20.sock\fR on macOS).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR udev (7),
.BR systemd (1)
